+/// keep exactly this read inside one complete-or-fail `scan` (`multipart::MAX_SESSIONS`,
+/// `0016:1470`), and each session's two ranges are bounded by its own admission caps. A
+/// session is read whatever its state, so only its key is: it names the upload whose ranges
+/// hold the records, and one that names no upload hides which ranges are its.
